 ----------
 
@@ -101,7 +116,9 @@ the stream runs, FW_READY 200 us later, the firmware's status word 2 ms
 after entry, a reply 50 us after a request), the
 ROM info word 0x0120315A and the firmware configuration constants of the
 reply (4096/4096-byte mailboxes, 128 KiB trace log, 16 pipelines, 4
-libraries).  Traces print them as "(model value)".
+libraries), and the pipeline table's answers (the status numbers other
+than the plan's 5, the state a new pipeline is tracked in, the table
+vanishing with the firmware's power).  Traces print them as "(model value)".
 
